  "execution": {
   "depth": "MoGe-2 through the product's MoGeDepthModel on this Mac's Metal (MPS) device, 228 photographs; no remote or paid compute",
   "features": "pycolmap 4.2.0 SIFT on the CPU",
   "machine": "Apple M5 Max, macOS 26.7",
   "scripts": "the pre-registration's bound .py.txt copies, run as they are bound"
  },
  "findings": [
   "The joined changed pair, held2-courtyard-121-c1 (1, 2): an object that appeared between the photographs, whose own surface covers 1.23 percent of the pair's shared view (held-out/diagnosis.log.txt, box_share.py). The class counts 3.56 percent, because it measures the part's bounding sphere plus 5 cm, and anything over 2 percent is changed. The comparison finds 1.5 to 1.7 percent under every motion, under its 2 percent threshold, in version 1 and version 2 alike: the pair is joined by a change smaller than the policy refuses, and named changed by a class wider than the change.",
   "The joinable pairs refused as changed, five across the two arms, all come from one defect in version 2. The change comparison warped with the motion the zoom refinement found (its rotation and translation belong with a zoomed lens) while carrying the photographs through their own, unzoomed lenses. held2-room-221-m1 (0, 1), whose photograph 1 lens the focal refinement left 5.1 percent off: zoom 0.961, translation 0.010 m zoomed against 0.098 m without; the comparison under the zoomed motion disagrees over 0.171 and under a pure turn over 0.104, the smaller refusing, and under the unzoomed motion over 0.000, as version 1's did (perturbed arm: 0.135 zoomed, 0.052 turned, 0.000 unzoomed). held2-room-222-s2 (1, 2) and 222-c2 (1, 2) in the perturbed arm, zooms 1.025 and 0.974: 0.0258 and 0.0359 against 0.000. held2-courtyard-122-s2 (1, 2) in the exif arm, zoom 0.995: 0.0529 against 0.0164 under the unzoomed motion with the depth-edge bands; without the bands, as version 1 compares, 0.0557, and version 1 refuses it in both arms. Each diagnosed share equals the changed share the run recorded for that pair. Measured after the held-out run, on it, and so not a result for any version.",
   "The perturbed arm's misregistration: its worst pair is held2-courtyard-122-s2 (1, 2), joined there and refused in the exif arm, a hand-held pair 0.12 m apart whose irreducible parallax is 1.21 degrees at the 95th percentile and whose drawn misregistration is 2.20: 0.985 beyond the parallax. Version 1 on the same split, which refused that pair in both arms, measured 0.430 against the same 0.411.",
   "The zoom refinement did what it was for: no pair was named moved or changed wrongly in either arm, where version 1 named 3 and 4 moved pairs changed on the same photographs.",
   "A set joined in 2.5 s at the median and 5.3 s at most in each arm, two arms at once, on a machine other work was loading. An observation, not a budgeted timing."
  ],
